ligned}\\text{Var}[\\overset{―}{X}] & =\\frac{9}{100} \\\\  & =0.09.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\text{SE}[\\overset{―}{X}]=\\sqrt{0.09}=0.3.\n$$"} :step/id #uuid "e819b894-7ed2-5c6c-9756-eea6cdfe101a" :step/next {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186447169}}] :activity/title "Variance of Sample Means" :activity/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045464 :db/ident :activity.type/review} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186447161}]}
